# Cabinet Sutherland — Mjidea library build

When building or expanding the Mjidea essay library:

1. Use `team/CABINET-SUTHERLAND.md` and `brand/VOICE.md`
2. Topics live in `topics/topics-500.json` (and growth beyond)
3. Essays publish to `site/src/content/blog/*.md` with frontmatter: title, description, pubDate, tags, category, draft:false, thesis
4. Human voice only — no “In today’s world”, delve, tapestry, game-changer, ultimate guide
5. Structure: problem → lived stake → behavioral reframe → concrete move → quiet close
6. Dual-write batch reports to `reports/war-room/` and `reports/ceo/`
7. Site must stay fast at 500+ posts (pagination / categories)
